{"assets":["/statement-assets/ac2f9d89243e110113572f18a710d1059162a4045ced8cb2be8e057deac6ef98.png"],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"294","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A. Shaass and Oskols"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Shaass has decided to hunt some birds. There are "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" horizontal electricity wires aligned parallel to each other. Wires are numbered "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1"},{"kind":"text","text":" to "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" from top to bottom. On each wire there are some oskols sitting next to each other. Oskol is the name of a delicious kind of birds in Shaass's territory. Supposed there are "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ai"},{"kind":"text","text":" oskols sitting on the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th wire."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/ac2f9d89243e110113572f18a710d1059162a4045ced8cb2be8e057deac6ef98.png"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"container"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Sometimes Shaass shots one of the birds and the bird dies (suppose that this bird sat at the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th wire). Consequently all the birds on the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th wire to the left of the dead bird get scared and jump up on the wire number "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i - 1"},{"kind":"text","text":", if there exists no upper wire they fly away. Also all the birds to the right of the dead bird jump down on wire number "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i + 1"},{"kind":"text","text":", if there exists no such wire they fly away. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Shaass has shot "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":" birds. You're given the initial number of birds on each wire, tell him how many birds are sitting on each wire after the shots."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of the input contains an integer "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(1 ≤ n ≤ 100)"},{"kind":"text","text":". The next line contains a list of space-separated integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a1, a2, ..., an"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(0 ≤ ai ≤ 100)"},{"kind":"text","text":". "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The third line contains an integer "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(0 ≤ m ≤ 100)"},{"kind":"text","text":". Each of the next "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":" lines contains two integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"xi"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"yi"},{"kind":"text","text":". The integers mean that for the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th time Shaass shoot the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"yi"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th (from left) bird on the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"xi"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th wire, "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(1 ≤ xi ≤ n, 1 ≤ yi)"},{"kind":"text","text":". It's guaranteed there will be at least "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"yi"},{"kind":"text","text":" birds on the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"xi"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th wire at that moment."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"On the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th line of the output print the number of birds on the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th wire."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"5\n10 10 10 10 10\n5\n2 5\n3 13\n2 12\n1 13\n4 6\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"0\n12\n5\n0\n16\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"3\n2 4 1\n1\n2 2\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"3\n0\n3\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"A","problemCode":"294A","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/294/problem/A"}